[ti:Amazing Grace]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Amazing grace, how sweet the sound
[00:12.44]That saved a wretch like me
[00:24.88]I once was lost, but now am found
[00:35.08]Was blind, but now I see
[00:45.28]Twas grace that taught my heart to fear
[00:55.68]And grace my fears relieved
[01:06.08]How precious did that grace appear
[01:16.48]The hour I first believed
[01:26.88]When we've been there ten thousand years
[01:37.08]Bright shining as the sun
[01:47.28]We've no less days to sing God's praise
[01:57.68]Than when we'd first begun
